# README flythrough: 8 s over the oak forest, through the floating isles, down to the glacier.
ui off
anim 0
anim run
time 0.37
pos 260 128 -360
look 90 2
settle
wait 120
record target/media/fly
waypoint 60 150 -380 92 4
waypoint -160 185 -430 115 4
waypoint -300 170 -600 160 -6
waypoint -340 125 -800 200 -16
fly_path 480
record off
